cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Beam Profiler for the Thorlabs Zelux CS165MU1"
abstract: >-
  A live laser beam profiler for the Thorlabs Zelux CS165MU1 camera: live
  image, ISO 11146 second-moment (D4-sigma) widths, Gaussian fits, profiles,
  trends and an M² / waist fit, with a built-in beam simulator.
authors:
  - given-names: Chongwu
    family-names: Xie
version: "0.3.9"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/balabalabalalaba/zelux-beam-profiler"
keywords:
  - laser beam profiler
  - beam profiling
  - ISO 11146
  - D4-sigma
  - M2
  - Thorlabs Zelux
